OL,3,GNEWSACouple's 'slightly weird' dirty
OL,4,Asign cleaning hobby
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple have admitted they have a
OL,7,F"slightly weird hobby": cleaning
OL,8,FSussex's road signs and filming them
OL,9,Ffor followers on their social media.
OL,11,FPaul Richmond-Watson and his wife Ruth,
OL,12,Ffrom Brighton, started the idea in
OL,13,FSeptember and are already being
OL,14,Frecognised when out cleaning, with
OL,15,Fresidents also recommending dirty signs
OL,16,Fto clean.
OL,18,FThey said they find cleaning road signs
OL,19,Ftherapeutic and good for their mental
OL,20,Fhealth, as well as the community.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
