OL,3,GNEWSACouple's 'slightly weird' dirty
OL,4,Asign cleaning hobby
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Sussex Highways said it was great
OL,7,Fto see people taking pride in towns but
OL,8,Fadded sign cleaning by roads can be
OL,9,Fdangerous and encouraged the public to
OL,10,Freport dirty signs.
